  << /ActualText (Designed and built for A\055Level Design \046 Technology\072 a rehabilitation device for ICU patients facing muscular atrophy\056 The final prototype features a pulley resistance system\054 an adjustable weight box\054 bidirectional resistance\054 a freely rotating boot attachment and a removable patient\055specific boot which helps prevent foot\055drop\056 Development ran from early wood and cardboard proof\055of\055concept prototypes through CAD modelling to the final steel and acrylic build\056\015\n\015\n\n\015\n\n)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 1895 0 R
