1918 0 obj
  << /ActualText (A rocking kneeling chair that combines the Varier Variable\220s rocking geometry \050Peter Opsvik\054 1979\051 with Eames\055style moulded plywood shells\054 fusing classic lounge furniture with ergonomic work seating\056 The final design makes use of powder\055coated cast aluminium\054 walnut\055faced moulded ply\054 rubber shock mounts and leather upholstery\056 My own contributions are a tip\055and\055roll transport feature\054 and anthropometric checks against P5 and P95 users that exposed a foot clash and drove a frame redesign\056 Modelled\054 analysed and rendered in Fusion\054 with FEA under BS EN seating test loads\056\n\n)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 1919 0 R
     /Pg 1026 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

